{"id":"64d902370bb28edb","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-binary-many-one-reduction.md","title":"Computable Many-One Reduction","display":"df-computable-many-one-reduction — Computable Many-One Reduction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-binary-many-one-reduction","aliases":["73-df-binary-many-one-reduction","73-df-computable-many-one-reduction"],"display":"df-computable-many-one-reduction — Computable Many-One Reduction","depends_on":["[[73-df-string-function-computation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-binary-many-one-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-binary-many-one-reduction</span><span>73-df-computable-many-one-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-computable-many-one-reduction — Computable Many-One Reduction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fd9e85296ed6a24d\" href=\"?note=fd9e85296ed6a24d\" title=\"73-df-string-function-computation\">73-df-string-function-computation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*\\)</span> (binary languages)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartialComp}_{\\mathbf 2,\\mathbf 2}\">\\(\\operatorname{PartialComp}_{\\mathbf 2,\\mathbf 2}\\)</span> (partial string-computability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd9e85296ed6a24d\" href=\"?note=fd9e85296ed6a24d\" title=\"73-df-string-function-computation\">73-df-string-function-computation</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable\\text{-}many\\text{-}one\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\nA\\leq_m B\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists f:\\mathbf 2^*\\to\\mathbf 2^*\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{PartialComp}_{\\mathbf 2,\\mathbf 2}(f)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\mathbf 2^*\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable\\text{-}many\\text{-}one\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\nA\\leq_m B\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists f:\\mathbf 2^*\\to\\mathbf 2^*\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{PartialComp}_{\\mathbf 2,\\mathbf 2}(f)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\mathbf 2^*\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The reduction function is total, single valued, and computable; logical equivalence replaces the former erroneous defining equality inside the membership test.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-string-function-computation","status":"resolved","id":"fd9e85296ed6a24d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-string-function-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-string-function-computation","status":"resolved","id":"fd9e85296ed6a24d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PartialComp}_{\\mathbf 2,\\mathbf 2}$ (partial string-computability predicate, see [[73-df-string-function-computation]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PartialComp}_{\\mathbf 2,\\mathbf 2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable\\text{-}many\\text{-}one\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\nA\\leq_m B\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists f:\\mathbf 2^*\\to\\mathbf 2^*\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{PartialComp}_{\\mathbf 2,\\mathbf 2}(f)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\mathbf 2^*\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)\n\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1137,"backlinks":[{"id":"6530ee2fa245fe46","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\leq_m$ (computable many-one reducibility on binary languages, see [[73-df-binary-many-one-reduction]])"},{"id":"4e3aa745a4d7cc44","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\leq_m$ (computable many-one reducibility, see [[73-df-binary-many-one-reduction]])"},{"id":"9af64ac4f14ac427","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\leq_m$ (computable many-one reducibility, see [[73-df-binary-many-one-reduction]])"}],"outgoing":["fd9e85296ed6a24d"]}